    "body": "Maybe it would be better to refactor this to also handle the name being None and reduce the duplication on line 200-211 something like:\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nfn alias_name(name: Option<String>, aliases: &HashMap<String, &str>) -> Option<String> {\r\n    if let Some(name) = name {\r\n        match aliases.get(&name) {\r\n            None => Some(name),\r\n            Some(alias) => Some((*alias).to_string()),\r\n        }\r\n    } else {\r\n        None\r\n     }\r\n }\r\n```",
